msgid "1 功能作用说明"
msgstr "1\. Function Description"

#: ../../zh/triton_api/Shape_Manipulation_Ops/broadcast_to.md:5
msgid "将张量广播到目标形状，自动处理维度对齐。广播操作不会复制数据，而是通过改变张量的形状和步长来实现。"
msgstr ""
"Broadcasts the tensor to the target shape, automatically handling dimension "
"alignment. The broadcast operation does not copy data; it is achieved by "
"changing the tensor's shape and stride."

#: ../../zh/triton_api/Shape_Manipulation_Ops/broadcast_to.md:7
msgid "**语法：**"
msgstr "**Syntax:**"

#: ../../zh/triton_api/Shape_Manipulation_Ops/broadcast_to.md:9
msgid "`triton.language.broadcast_to(input, shape)` - 函数调用形式"
msgstr "`triton.language.broadcast_to(input, shape)` - function call form"

#: ../../zh/triton_api/Shape_Manipulation_Ops/broadcast_to.md:10
msgid "`input.broadcast_to(shape)` - 成员函数形式"
msgstr "`input.broadcast_to(shape)` - member function form"

#: ../../zh/triton_api/Shape_Manipulation_Ops/broadcast_to.md:12
msgid "**功能：**"
msgstr "**Function:**"

#: ../../zh/triton_api/Shape_Manipulation_Ops/broadcast_to.md:14
msgid "自动处理维度对齐，将大小为1的维度扩展到目标形状中对应维度的大小"
msgstr ""
"Automatically handles dimension alignment, expanding dimensions of size 1 to"
" match the corresponding dimension size in the target shape"

#: ../../zh/triton_api/Shape_Manipulation_Ops/broadcast_to.md:15
msgid "保持数据不变，仅改变张量的形状信息"
msgstr ""
"Keeps the data unchanged, only modifies the shape information of the tensor"

